# Scoped to infra/ only, the same way the Unity prototype carries its own.
# The root .gitignore is left alone.

# State. Terraform writes resource metadata -- and anything a provider marks
# sensitive -- into state in plaintext. It must never be committed.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Provider plugins and the local working directory.
.terraform/

# Holds a personal email address for the budget alarm. The .example template
# is tracked in its place.
terraform.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
